---
title: "updateMemberAdmin (stem-system: Admin Member Update)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_admin: checkAdmin()
    q_check_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_validate: admin confirmed
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return error (admin required)
    q_validate --> q_parse: profileAdminUpdateSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_parse --> q_invalid: parse failed
    q_parse --> q_update_meta: valid
    q_invalid --> [*]: return first field error
    q_update_meta --> q_get_user: adminClient.auth.admin.getUserById(userId)
    q_get_user --> q_set_meta: adminClient.auth.admin.updateUserById(metadata with name)
    q_set_meta --> q_ensure_gen: ensureGenerationRoleExists(generation)
    q_ensure_gen --> q_update_member: supabase.members.update(generation, student_number, status)
    q_update_member --> q_delete_teams: delete member_team_relations where member_id
    q_delete_teams --> q_insert_teams: insert new member_team_relations (if team_ids)
    q_insert_teams --> q_sync_nick: syncDiscordNickname(provider_id, fullName)
    q_sync_nick --> q_sync_roles: syncDiscordRoles(provider_id)
    q_sync_roles --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath(/dashboard/admin/members)
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: checkAdmin queries members table for is_admin = true
        INV-002: admin check uses cookie-based client (RLS applies)
    end note

    note right of q_delete_teams
        INV-003: team relations are replaced atomically (delete all then insert new)
    end note
